"Demo slice for RogiKotha: a minimal working site for the demo. A patient registers and signs in (email and password), edits their own profile (display name and preferences), writes an experience about a seeded doctor and can edit it later, attaches document files to it (stored privately; shown only as \"Documents attached — not medically validated\", and never public unless the virus scan passed), and another signed-in user reads the published experience and comments on it. Bengali and English, synthetic data only, all hard rules kept. Nothing else: no staff console, moderation, notifications, password reset, export or PWA."
